<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12110" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cȳ^clus</span></b> , i, m.,
		= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a circle.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cycli axium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Isid. Orig. 3, 36</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Astron. t. t., <i>a cycle, recurring period</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">paschalis,</span>”
				<i>the Easter cycle of ninety-five years</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Isid. Orig. 6, 17, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lunae,</span>”
				<i>the lunar cycle of nineteen years</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 6, 17, 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Med.
			t. t., <i>a periodic change, a recurrence</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">resumptionis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Tard. 1, 1, 21</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">metasyncriticus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 1, 24</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cyclo curare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. Art. Vet. 5, 5, 3</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">3, 6, 1</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>An instrument for branding</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Veg. Vet. 2, 5, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 6,
			11</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
